[{"category":"section","location":"#SAMBO","page":"Home","text":"SAMBO is a Julia-native global black-box optimizer with SCE-UA, SMBO, and iterative simplicial homology global optimization (SHGO), mixed-variable spaces, constraints, ask/tell operation, observation tables, and optional Makie plots.\n\nusing SAMBO, Random\n\nspace = SearchSpace(\n    count=0:20,\n    rate=Continuous(0.1, 2.0),\n    method=Choices(:fast, :accurate),\n)\n\nresult = minimize(\n    space;\n    algorithm=SMBO(candidate_pool=512),\n    maximum_evaluations=30,\n    rng=MersenneTwister(42),\n) do point\n    (point.count - 8)^2 + (point.rate - 0.7)^2 +\n        (point.method == :fast ? 1.0 : 0.0)\nend\n\n(minimum(result), minimizer(result), evaluation_count(result))\n\nFor externally evaluated objectives:\n\nstate = init(Problem(space), SMBO(); maximum_evaluations=100)\nbatch = ask!(state, 4)\ntell!(state, batch, map(expensive_measurement, batch))\n\nPartial completion, cancellation, failure recording, and restart are available through tell!(state, batch, indices, values), cancel!, fail!, checkpoint, and restore.","title":"SAMBO"},{"category":"section","location":"#Explicit-policies","page":"Home","text":"Semantic choices are values passed to the algorithms:\n\nSMBO(\n    refit_schedule=SquareRootRefit(2),\n    candidate_sampler=MixtureCandidates(\n        UniformCandidates(),\n        EliteGaussianCandidates(0.1);\n        global_fraction=0.25,\n    ),\n    candidate_equality=ApproximateCandidateEquality(1e-8),\n)\n\nSHGO(\n    topology=KNearestTopology(neighbors=8),\n    minimization_schedule=MinimizeAtTermination(),\n)\n\nCandidate generation, topology, surrogate uncertainty, refitting, duplicate handling, and SHGO local-minimization timing are never changed by an implicit fallback.\n\nDeterministic SurrogatesBase models pair with GreedyMean(). Use DistanceUncertainty(model) only when distance-based uncertainty is deliberately part of the model.\n\nSearch-space coordinates are parametric:\n\nSearchSpace(Float32; x=Continuous(-1, 1), n=0:10)\nSearchSpace(BigFloat; x=Continuous(big\"-1\", big\"1\"))\n\nconvergencedata includes known observations at evaluation zero by default. regretdata counts evaluated observations only. Constrained partial dependence uses FeasibleConditionalDependence(); select UnconstrainedModelDependence() explicitly to query the fitted model without feasibility conditioning.\n\n","title":"Explicit policies"},{"category":"type","location":"#SAMBO.Box","page":"Home","text":"A homogeneous, continuous hyperrectangle.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.Box"},{"category":"type","location":"#SAMBO.Choices","page":"Home","text":"An unordered categorical search dimension.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.Choices"},{"category":"type","location":"#SAMBO.Continuous","page":"Home","text":"A bounded continuous search dimension.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.Continuous"},{"category":"type","location":"#SAMBO.MinimizeEveryRefinement","page":"Home","text":"Simplicial homology global optimization using iterative sampling-complex refinement and local minimization of topographical minima.\n\nsampling_points new vertices are added on each refinement. local_solver is dispatched through local_minimize!, allowing external local solvers to extend the algorithm without changing SHGO.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.MinimizeEveryRefinement"},{"category":"type","location":"#SAMBO.SearchSpace","page":"Home","text":"A heterogeneous search space. Keyword construction decodes points as named tuples.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.SearchSpace"},{"category":"type","location":"#SAMBO.TopologicalMultistart","page":"Home","text":"Experimental Delaunay/neighbor-graph multistart search.\n\nThis is not an implementation of simplicial homology global optimization.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.TopologicalMultistart"},{"category":"method","location":"#SAMBO.convergencedata-Tuple{Result}","page":"Home","text":"Return evaluation indices and the running best objective.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.convergencedata"},{"category":"method","location":"#SAMBO.evaluationsdata-Tuple{Result}","page":"Home","text":"Return decoded observations and latent coordinates for evaluation-matrix plots.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.evaluationsdata"},{"category":"method","location":"#SAMBO.local_minimize!-Tuple{SAMBO.SHGOState, SAMBO.PatternSearch, Vararg{Any, 5}}","page":"Home","text":"Locally minimize a SHGO topographical candidate.\n\nPackages can extend this method for their local-solver type. Implementations must consume objective evaluations through state.core and return (point, value).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.local_minimize!"},{"category":"method","location":"#SAMBO.partialdependence-Tuple{Result}","page":"Home","text":"Compute one- or two-dimensional partial dependence from a fitted surrogate.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.partialdependence"},{"category":"method","location":"#SAMBO.predictmeanvariance!-Tuple{Any, Any, SAMBO.GaussianProcessModel, Any}","page":"Home","text":"Predict posterior means and latent-function variances.\n\nThe returned variance excludes observation noise.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.predictmeanvariance!"},{"category":"method","location":"#SAMBO.regretdata-Tuple{Result}","page":"Home","text":"Return cumulative regret relative to optimum (the observed minimum by default).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SAMBO.regretdata"}]
